{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/s72xofmh","slide":2,"text":"If the decision is not captured with who, when, and why, it cannot be audited.","textPreview":"If the decision is not captured with who, when, and why, it cannot be audited.","textChars":78,"textLines":1,"bbox":[694,522,470,46]}
